@startuml
actor Siswa
participant "View" as View
participant "AbsensiSiswaController" as Controller
participant "SiswaLiveLocation" as ModelLokasi
participant "AbsensiSiswa" as ModelAbsen

Siswa -> View : Membuka Menu Absen Harian Mandiri
View -> Controller : Permintaan Halaman Absen
Controller --> View : Tampilkan Tombol Absen & Permintaan GPS

Siswa -> View : Klik "Absen Hadir" (Lokasi terkirim)
View -> Controller : POST /siswa/absensi-mandiri
Controller -> Controller : Validasi Waktu & Radius Lokasi
Controller -> ModelLokasi : insert_data(koordinat)
Controller -> ModelAbsen : insert_data(status="Hadir")
ModelAbsen --> Controller : Sukses
Controller --> View : Notifikasi "Berhasil Absen"
View --> Siswa : Tampilan Dashboard Siswa
@enduml
